### Database & Data Persistence

#### [NEW] [hr_db.py](file:///c:/Users/MekaKishore/workspaces/RAG/rag_pro/app/db/hr_db.py)
* Create SQLite database schema using SQLAlchemy:
  * `jobs`: Stores `job_id`, `user_id`, `title`, `created_at`, `jd_filename`, `jd_parsed_json`.
  * `candidates`: Stores `candidate_id`, `job_id`, `name`, `email`, `filename`, `processed_status`.
  * `candidate_profiles`: Stores extracted structured candidate profile (skills, experience years, education, roles).
  * `candidate_scores`: Stores calculated final score, fit category (`Strong Fit`, `Moderate Fit`, `Weak Fit`), and component score breakdowns (`required_skills_score`, `experience_score`, etc.).
  * `candidate_evidence`: Stores supporting citation snippets with `skill`, `matched_bool`, `evidence_quote`, `document_name`, `page_number`.

