  6. `test_evidence_citations()`: Verifies supporting quotes and page numbers are present.
  7. `test_hallucination_protection()`: Ensures unmentioned skills (e.g. AWS) are never marked present.
  8. `test_candidate_ranking_order()`: Strong Candidate $>$ Moderate Candidate $>$ Weak Candidate.
  9. `test_multi_job_isolation()`: Candidates for Job A do not leak into Job B results.
  10. `test_existing_rag_regression()`: Verifies original document upload & Q&A endpoints remain 100% functional.

